<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe March CPI rises to 19.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe March CPI rises to 19.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index rose 2.6 percent in March from February, bringing the year-on-year rate to 19.9 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    March 1997  Feb 1997    March 1996</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +19.9	 +19.0	 +23.7</p>
<p>All-items index		 474.5	 462.6	 395.5</p>
<p>Food-only index		 648.0	 649.1	 547.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
